==Icelandic==
{{Fallbeyging hk sb 01 ö|forn|fn}}

===Etymology===
From ''[[for]]'' meaning "[[pro]]" or "[[before]]" + ''[[nafn]]'' meaning "[[name]]". In total it means "before a name" or "in front of a name". A [[calque]] of the {{etyl|la|is}} word ''[[pronomen#Latin|pronomen]]''.

===Noun===
'''fornafn''' {{n}}

# [[first name]] (i.e. [[given name]])
# {{grammar|lang=is}} [[pronoun]]

